      en: ["Fâncel Peak stands at an elevation of 1684 meters above sea level.", "It belongs to one of the largest well-preserved volcanic calderas in Europe.", "The bedrock is composed of Neogene volcanic materials.", "It serves as a prime location for observing the Carpathian brown bear.", "The summit offers views into the historically significant Lăpușna Valley.", "The area is characterized by high humidity and significant rainfall."],
